#
# ABox fixture for the deception-licensed-falsehood NEGATIVE competency question
# (gmeow:cqDataFile overlay). Verbatim externalization of
# test_competency_deception_licensed_falsehood_query: a fiction claim asserted
# accordingTo a narrative frame with licensed-falsehood veridicality, and NO lie
# event projecting it — so the query must return EMPTY (the safety property holds).

@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix exd:   <https://example.org/test/> .

exd:fictionClaim a gmeow:StandpointClaim ;
    gmeow:accordingTo exd:narrativeFrame ;
    gmeow:claimVeridicality gmeow:veridicalityLicensedFalsehood .
